#: resources/views/admin/menus/settings.php:1558
msgid ""
"Currency Switcher for WooCommerce automatically detects the Geo-Location IP "
"of your customer and the country from which they are browsing your store. "
"When any page from your store loads, the extension displays all the prices "
"in the home currency of the customer."
